window.products.push({"id":156087,"name":"Supplying Demand DA47-10160H 1488655 Refrigerator Freezer Defrost Thermostat Replacement","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71sMFoKQp3L._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Alternate part numbers include AP4136157 and PS4140844. The defrost thermostat, or bi-metallic switch, controls the temperature in the freezer as it defrosts. Once the temperature reaches a preset level, the defrost thermostat opens. When it opens the electric current to the defrost heater is shut off. A faulty thermostat may keep the defrost heating elements from turning on or keep them on too long leading to other issues or damage. If you still have issues after replacing the thermostat the main control board may be faulty. Fits model specific refrigerators. It is important to disconnect your appliance from the power supply before servicing. Supplying Demand replacement parts are compatible with Major Brands, but you should always verify fitment with your specific model. We have included a video in the product gallery to help you find your model number and information in the description below. SD products come in Supplying Demand packaging.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71sMFoKQp3L._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Supplying Demand","source_asin":"B0831Q5LBD","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-156087","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0831Q5LBD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0831Q5LBD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
