window.products.push({"id":156230,"name":"Stove Range Covers For Electric Stove Top, 21×29.5 Inch Extra Thick, Electric Stove Glass/Ceramic Cooktop Cover Protector, Flat Top Anti-Slip Coating,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71iv-dEcxBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Heat Resistant & High Tensile Strength】Made of premium silicone coated with a quilted fabric surface. The biggest feature is its high tensile strength. The tensile strength is 6.1-6.7g/d in standard state and 5.4-5.8g/d in wet state. It has good heat resistance and has no effect on the strength when the temperature reaches 220°C (=428°F). 【Protect Glass/Ceramic Cooktop】The glass stove top cover can protects your glass stove top, ceramic or granite counter top from scratches, scrapes, and glass cracks dirt & spills! The bottom part has a nonslip silicone texture that holds the mat in place and helps from slipping off the stove. 【Second Countertop Space】The electric stove top cover measures 21 x 29.5inch. Our stovetop cover will be the right choice for those who want more counter space. You can put basically anything on this cover and use your stove top as an extra work area ! 【Can be Hung On The Wall】Another cool feature of this product is that it can be hung on the wall. You could fold it and put it in a drawer. But if you hang it above the stove on a wall, it will even protect the wall or backsplash. After you are done with the cooking, you will have fewer surfaces to clean ! 【Flat Design & Easy-to-Clean】The flat surface merges with the glass stove top, and if you look from a distance, it seems as if nothing is on the stove. They are easy to clean, and you can even put them in a dishwasher. Usable on glass stoves (electric or induction).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71iv-dEcxBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"voxmude","source_asin":"B0BYT85BZF","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-156230","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BYT85BZF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BYT85BZF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":156231,"name":"Whirlpool Part Number W10245222: COMPLETE DOOR (Stainless)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61URnrMW30L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Genuine Original Equipment Manufacturer (OEM) parts! This door assembly (part number W10245222) is for microwaves. Door assembly W10245222 includes the handle, panels and shielding. A service technician should install the door assembly because the door contains shielding components. The technician must correctly test the microwave for leaks in the microwave shield before you can safely use the microwave. For Whirlpool.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61URnrMW30L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Whirlpool","source_asin":"B002M6FUTG","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-156231","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B002M6FUTG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B002M6FUTG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":156232,"name":"AppliaFit Dryer Drum Belt Compatible With, Maytag Dryer Drum Belt 33001777. (1-Pack)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71tYDEevM5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Replacing your dryer drum belt is a quick and easy fix for your dryer, using your AppliaFit 33001777 dryer drum belt. This dryer drum belt attaches to a pulley system which is what turns the drum during your drying cycle. The dryer belt goes in between the dryer motor and the dryer drum. If your dryer belt breaks, the dryer will no longer work like it should. Replacing the dryer belt can fix the following problems: - Dryer making loud noises - Dryer not starting - Dryer won’t tumble - Dryer can't produce enough heat - Dryer won't heat up at all This dryer drum belt is compatible with Maytag dryer models. The following list of compatibility include but is not limited to models: MDE14PDACL MDE14PDACQ MDE14PDACW MDE14PDADL MDE14PDADW MDE14PDAGW MDE14PNAGW MDE14PNAYW MDE14PNAZW MDE14PRAYW MDE14PRAZW MDE14PSADW MDE16CSAGW MDE16CSAKA MDE16CSAKQ MDE16CSAYA MDE16CSAYQ MDE16CSAYW MDE16CSAZA MDE16CSAZQ MDE16CSAZW MDE16CSDGW MDE16CSDYW MDE16CSDZW MDE16MNAGW MDE16MNAYW MDE16MNAZW MDE16MNDGW MDE16MNDYW MDE16MNDZW MDE16PDAGW MDE16PDAUW MDE16PDAYA MDE16PDAYQ MDE16PDAYW MDE16PDAZW MDE16PDCZW MDE16PDDGW MDE16PDDYW MDE16PDDZW MDE16PRAGW MDE16PRAYW MDE16PRAZW MDE16PRDYW MDE16PRDZW MDE16PSAZW MDE16PSDZW MDE21PDAGW MDE21PDAYQ MDE21PDAYW MDE21PDDGW MDE21PDDYW MDE21PNAGW MDE21PNAYW etc. Don't see your model listed? Let us know and we'll be happy to help you find the belt that fits your dryer. Often times the same part may have different numbers, this part is compatible to replace the following: AP285924, AP4043963, 33002535, 33001777, 791135, PS82842. Packaging may vary. The brand names and logos are the registered trademarks of their respective owners. Any use of the brand name or model designation for this product is made solely for purposes of demonstrating compatibility.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71tYDEevM5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AppliaFit","source_asin":"B087N53BJ8","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-156232","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B087N53BJ8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B087N53BJ8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":156233,"name":"LivingAid Reusable K Cups for Keurig 2.0 & 1.0 Brewers -4 Packs Refillable Coffee Pods, Universal Kcup Filters, Eco-Friendly and Easy to Clean.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":6.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81-3lUZDmlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Wide Compatible With Keurig 2.0 & 1.0 Brewers :LivingAid reusable k cups can work with Keurig 2.0 & 1.0 Brewers: K15, K31, K40, K44, K45, K50, K60, K66, K70, K77, K100, K135, K140, K200, K300, K350, K400, K450, K500, B31, B40, B44, B50, B60, B66, B70, B77, B100, B140, B200 K-Elite, K-Select, K-Cafe, K-Compact, K-Classic K50/K55, K-Latte etc. BUT NOT applicable to keurig K-Supreme/Plus/Smart. Premium Quality and Long-lasting Durability: Our LivingAid k cup reusable filters are made with high-quality, 100% BPA-free material and feature a 304 stainless steel mesh that is resistant to rust. This ensures that our filters are not only safe for use but also durable and long-lasting, allowing you to enjoy your favorite coffee for a long time. Cost-effective and Reduce Waste: Tired of spending a fortune on disposable coffee pods? Our reusable K cups for Keurig allow you to brew your favorite coffee at a fraction of the cost. Our LivingAid reusable coffee pod is the perfect alternative to plastic k cups that end up in oceans or landfills every day. By using our refillable k cups, you are making a positive impact on the environment. Easy to Use and Clean: Our refillable k cups are user-friendly and can be easily filled with your preferred ground coffee. After use, simply rinse the filter for a quick and hassle-free cleaning experience. Full Money-Back Guarantee: At LivingAid, we are confident in the quality of our reusable k cups. If our refillable K cup fails to meet or exceed your expectations, you can return it for a full refund. Your satisfaction is our top priority!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81-3lUZDmlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LivingAid","source_asin":"B0C89JLQ7V","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-156233","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C89JLQ7V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C89JLQ7V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
