window.products.push({"id":156651,"name":"30 Inch Gas Cooktop, Maharlika Gas Stove Top Bulit-in with 5 Burner Stainless Steel Total 41,132 BTU, 30\" NG/LPG Convertible Cooktops Dual Fuel, Five ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":264.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ELXP4pK6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product dimensions: 29.92 in. L x 20.08 in. W x 4.13 in. H | Cutout dimensions: 29.13 in. L x 18.5 in. W. High Power Burners: Maharlika gas cooktop features 5 high-powered sealed burners: 1 x 11,262 BTU (3.3KW) + 2 x 10,240 BTU (3.0KW) + 1 x 5,975 BTU (1.75KW) + 1 x 3,415 BTU (1.0KW). The gas stove is perfect for many forms of cooking like boiling, searing, frying pan and stir-frying etc. Fasten cooking speeds and provide great efficiency for your kitchen. Premium Quality: The panel of the propane stove is made of exquisite stainless steel. High temperature and corrosion resistance and easy to clean. Heavy cast iron grates support all kinds of heavy pots steadily. Rotary control automatic ignition, flexible and accurate gas regulation. Enjoy minimal cleanup with sealed burners to prevent food from falling into them. NG / LPG Convertible: The natural gas nozzle is preset and can be replaced by LPG nozzle to meet your different needs. The automatic electric pulse ignition uses a 110V AC power. Thermocouple Protection: The thermocouple flame-out failure device system(FFD) will shutoff the gas automatically if a flame is not detected to ensure your safety in an emergency. 24/7 At Your Service: We provide the 24-month warranty for the propane cooktop. If you are not satisfied with the product, we will provide a full refund or free exchange guarantee, please rest assured to buy. Please feel free to contact us if you have any after-sales problems.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ELXP4pK6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Maharlika","source_asin":"B0C4YS9JY1","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-156651","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C4YS9JY1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C4YS9JY1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
