window.products.push({"id":156707,"name":"UPGRADED 8577274 WP8577274 Dryer Thermistor Replacement by Blutoget - Fit for Whirlpool dryer thermistor GEW9200LW0, Ken-more 11087572602, May-tag MED","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":5.77,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41hKlbRwHjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"√√【UPGRADED QUALITY】:8577274 Dryer Thermistor is Dryer thermistor temperature sensor. Dryer Thermal Thermistor Fuse WP8577274 is located on top of the blower wheel housing next to the thermal fuse and monitors and helps regulate the temperature inside the dryer to prevents the dryer from overheating. wp8577274 whirlpool thermistor helps protecting your dryer and promotes efficiency.3976615 whirlpool thermistor is made from durable high-quality material.Ensures high durability and extends used time. √√【GREAT VALUE PACK】:Includes 1 x 8577274 Dryer Thermistor. 8577274 internal-bias thermistor is a resistance thermometer.You may need to replace the thermistor WP8577274 if the dryer is giving you the F23 error code or the dryer is not heating. 8577274 Thermistor can fix the following symptoms：No heat or not enough heat,Will not start,Shuts off too soon,Too hot. √√【HIGH COMPATIBILITY】:8577274 WP8577274 Dryer thermistor is made exactly fit for Whirlpool, Ken-more, May-tag, Kitchen-Aid. Replaces part numbers WP8577274, AP6013514, 1181075, 3390292, 3406294, 3976615, 772546, ER8577274, PS11746740, PS993287,AP3919451,WP8577274VP.If you are not sure about the model,please inform in time,we will solve your problem as soon as possible. √√【PERFECT MATCH】: 8577274 dryer thermistor can perfect work for Whirlpool 7MWGD5600BW0, 7MWGD7000EW2, 7MMGDX600BW0,7MMGD0600TB1, 7MMGDB855EC0, 4GWED5500YW1, 7MGGW9200MW3, 7MWGD8500EC0, 7MWGD8500EC1, 7MWGD8500EC2, 7MWGD8500SR0, 7MWGD8500SR1,7MWGD87HEDC0,7MWGD87HEDC1,7MWGD8800AW0, 7MWGD8800AW1, 7MWGD90HEFC0, 7MWGD90HEFW0, 7MWGD9150XW0.For Ken-more dryer 1106007299,11060884990, 11060992990,1106093699, 1107095299, 110C87561601, 11066134610, 11076134610,11066952690, 11074972301, 11074976301, 11074992301.For May-tag dryer YMED5100DW1, YMED7100DC1, YMED7100DW1, YMED8100DC1, YMED8100DW1, YMEDB755DW1, YMEDB755DW2, YMEDB765FC0,YMEDB765FW0,YMEDB835DW3,YMEDB835DW4,YMEDB855DC2,YMEDB855DC3, etc. √√【90 DAYS GUARANTEE】:Risk-free shopping, Whirlpool Dryer Thermistor WP8577274 is made of premium quality material,quality assurance and efficient service,supports 90 DAYS return and exchange.High quality, good price, high speed Amazon official logistics. If you are dissatisfied with the product, Contact us! We will show you a sincere attitude and satisfactory solution.We will try our best to solve the problem. Customer satisfaction is our tireless pursuit. √√【EASY TO INSTALL】:Dryer Thermal Thermistor Fuse for Whirlpool WP8577274 is easy to insyall.Unplug the dryer before installing this part. Wear work gloves to protect your hands.Note: This 8577274 thermistor should read approximately 11.9K Ohms of resistance at 70 degrees Fahrenheit (21’ Celsius). If WP8577274 Dryer thermistor is defective, it may prolong or shorten the drying time or cause a fault code.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41hKlbRwHjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Blutoget","source_asin":"B09NN19GX7","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-156707","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09NN19GX7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B09NN19GX7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
