window.products.push({"id":156774,"name":"6501KW2001A Washer Motor Rotor Position Sensor Compatible with Kenmore LG Washer Washing Machine Replaces 6501KW2001B AP5973402 6501KW2001D PS11706506","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41L0xEwo-pL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"【Faults that can be repaired】If your washer pump would not tumble, not agitate, not start, spins slowly, or had \"EO\" error, or had \"LE\" (locked rotor) error on L-G washer you made to replace the rotor position sensor. To confirm that the position sensor is faulty, unplug the washer when the symptom occurs. 【Quality Material】6501KW2001A washers motor rotor position sensor switch is made of premium quality white material and well-tested by the manufacturer. Ensure long-lasting and effective performance. Size about 2.9\"x2.2\" (LxW); Please you must check whether fit your machine. 【Compatible Replacement Models】Compatible with LG, Kenmore washing machine. It replaces for part numbers 6501KW2001B, 6501KW2001D, PS11706506, AP5973402, 3282954, EAP11706506. 6501KW2001A monitors the direction and speed of the spinning rotor and communicates these to the electronic control board. This part senses the position of the motor, commonly referred to as an RPS (rotor position sensor) or MPS (motor position sensor). 【Easy to Install】Installed easy faster, saving you money, time and energy. Just takes you a few minutes to install. Firstly, disconnect electric, hot and cold water supply and drain hose. Lay washer on its back. Removed nut from center housing. Removed screws from stater. Disconnect wires with a flat screwdriver at sensor and stater. Install new sensor and put everything back together. 【Responsible service】For any reason, you're not completely satisfied, you can ask for a replacement or full refund, no questions asked. Customer satisfaction is our relentless focus. Whenever problems come up, do not hesitate to let us know!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41L0xEwo-pL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"XFYBZN","source_asin":"B0B8XGD3PK","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-156774","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B8XGD3PK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B8XGD3PK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
