window.products.push({"id":156817,"name":"6931EL3003D Dryer Thermal Fuse & 6931EL3001F Dryer Thermostat Assembly Premium Replacement by Canamax - Compatible with LG & Kenmore Dryers","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.59,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Zcv7wxdOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Specifications The thermal fuse acts as a high-limit thermostat, and shuts off the heating element when the dryer overheats by cutting off power to the dryer. If the thermal fuse has blown, the dryer will not start. These fuses cannot be reset, so if yours has blown, you will need to replace it. A common reason for the thermal fuse to blow on a dryer is if the exhaust vent on your dryer is restricted or blocked. Hot air will be confined in the dryer and the fuse will trip and stop the electricity from flowing to the gas valve or heating element. - 6931EL3003D Dryer Thermal Fuse Replace part numbers: AP4440975, 1268366, PS3530485, EAP3530485- 6931EL3001F Dryer Thermostat Assembly Replace part numbers: AP5072172 Wide compatibility The perfect fit for most of the dryer models which are used worldwide (LG, Kenmore, GE). Fix the following symptoms No heat or not enough heatWill Not Start Takes too long to dry Ideal replacements We have designed the perfect replacements for your dryers that will not give you a headache while replacing them. Fits like the original parts and works as the original parts. Not of any difference and amazingly the perfect choice for you to make your dryer working efficiently again. A cost-efficient replacement parts that come in a two-piece packaging. All you will need for your machine in one pack. How great it is. Search no further!! Click Add to Cart to get this two-piece dryer parts replacement The LG brand names and logos are the registered trademarks of their respective owners. Any use of the LG brand name or model designation for this product is made solely for purposes of demonstrating compatibility.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Zcv7wxdOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Canamax","source_asin":"B0B3D279KB","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-156817","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B3D279KB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B3D279KB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
