window.products.push({"id":156883,"name":"NBYMS 9759242 Oven Thermal Fuse Replacement part for KitchenAid Whirlpool Sears Kenmore Maytag Ovens","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Nnr6hEnCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"CHANGING A THERMAL FUSE IN A WALL OVEN Before beginning, you will want to cut power to the oven through your circuit breaker. You will also want to have another person’s help to remove the oven as well as a table in front of the oven. Start by removing the mounting screws on the outer edge of your oven that secures it to the cabinet. Sliding the oven forward, you will be able to reach around and disconnect the power supply wiring from the oven. While you will typically have enough slack here to do this, be careful not to yank the oven too hard so as to damage this crucial wiring. Now enlisting the help of another, you should both carry the oven out and set it gently on your table or other workspaces. You will want to place it so you have easy access to the back panel of the oven. Removing the screws on the back panel, take it off and set it aside. Once off, you will be able to see the thermal fuse clearly by the wiring attached to it. There is surprisingly little back here, so it is hard to miss. Disconnecting the wires from the old thermal fuse and removing the mounting screws, you can now remove and dispose of it. After aligning the new fuse, attach the wires, remount it, and you can now reassemble and install your oven.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Nnr6hEnCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NBYMS","source_asin":"B09MLXFX8V","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-156883","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09MLXFX8V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B09MLXFX8V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
