window.products.push({"id":156951,"name":"Kndko Nugget Ice Maker with Chewy Ice,High Ice-Making of 33lbs/Day/10,000pcs, Self-Cleaning, One-Click Design, Portable Ice Maker Nugget for Home Bar ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ySJ78cdSL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Good Taste, Soft, Crushed Ice for freezing drinks TO-GO: -Never run out of nugget ice! Kndko Nugget Ice Maker makes pebble beloved ice. The pellet ice cubes retain its flavor and taste good that is different from traditional hard cubes of full cube or bullet ice. Being ready fast in 14mins for 100 ice nuggets and 10,000pcs/33 pounds in 24 hours. Never have to run out to stores again : - Refreshing chewy ice is made from compacted ice flakes and best for wine,cocktails,coffee and beverages and foods. Getting soft ice anytime anywhere without shopping and immediately available for a midnight snack or a big party.Whether it's summer or winter,the ice maker helps keep food fresh, create cold drinks, cool beers and so on. High Efficient & Save money: - This stainless steel countertop ice maker produces 100pcs in 14min and 10,000pcs/33 pounds in 24 hours.Take it out every hour when gets full, transfer the ice to a bag or bin and place it in freezer so that get 33lbs/day. No need to waste time to shop and saving up to 80% of money on ice cubes every day. Convenient Solution & Self-Cleaning: - Hard water is the cause of scale, one press on 'ICE/CLEAN' for 5 seconds to start self-cleaning program. Wait for 15 min and drain off the water to complete. By recirculating melted ice to the 1.1L water reservoir, you'll always have fresh ice on hand when your ice is running low. Simple to use & Portable: -The One-click design is easy for you to get fresh ice. The nugget ice maker has 3 indicators that will remind you to take out ice when the basket gets full and to add water when lacking of water. Easily moving the ice maker with size 11.3*8.6*12.6in, weight 18.7lb.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ySJ78cdSL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kndko","source_asin":"B0C1373K99","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-156951","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C1373K99","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C1373K99","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
